{"$schema":"https://docs.harness.design/files/harness/schema/v0.9.json","version":0.9,"lengthUnit":"mm","connectors":[{"id":"wss_fl","label":"ABS Wheel Speed FL","width":210,"partId":"cp_dt2s_ni","cavities":[{"id":"c1","designation":"1","signal":"VR+ (front left)"},{"id":"c2","designation":"2","signal":"VR- (front left)"}],"schematicPosition":{"x":0,"y":0},"layoutPosition":{"x":0,"y":-300}},{"id":"wss_fr","label":"ABS Wheel Speed FR","width":210,"partId":"cp_dt2s_ni","cavities":[{"id":"c1","designation":"1","signal":"VR+ (front right)"},{"id":"c2","designation":"2","signal":"VR- (front right)"}],"schematicPosition":{"x":0,"y":270},"layoutPosition":{"x":0,"y":300}},{"id":"ix_ws_front_r","label":"WS FRONT OUT - 6-way inline to ECU spur (IX_WS_FRONT)","width":270,"partId":"cp_dt04_6p","cavities":[{"id":"c1","designation":"1","signal":"+5V - VRC front supply (ECU sensor +5V)"},{"id":"c2","designation":"2","signal":"Gnd Out - VRC front ground"},{"id":"c3","designation":"3","signal":"FL conditioned out -> ECU-A A23 (DI 3)"},{"id":"c4","designation":"4","signal":"FR conditioned out -> ECU-B B21 (DI 4)"},{"id":"c5","designation":"5","signal":"Screen drain, combined 4-core cable -> SHIELD_A (A7)"},{"id":"c6","designation":"6","signal":"spare, plugged - was the FR cable's own drain (B17) when FL/FR were two separate output cables; superseded 2026-10-10, Route 9 rev 3"}],"schematicPosition":{"x":1500,"y":540},"layoutPosition":{"x":3300,"y":90}},{"id":"m8_vrc_f_in","label":"VRC front IN M8 cable plug - both sensor legs (FL, FR) land here; end of the IN piece (mates the VRC IN panel socket)","width":390,"partId":"cp_m8_plug_6m","layoutPosition":{"x":900,"y":0},"schematicPosition":{"x":660,"y":0},"cavities":[{"id":"c1","designation":"1","signal":"FL VR+"},{"id":"c2","designation":"2","signal":"FL VR-"},{"id":"c3","designation":"3","signal":"FL sensor drain"},{"id":"c4","designation":"4","signal":"FR VR+"},{"id":"c5","designation":"5","signal":"FR VR-"},{"id":"c6","designation":"6","signal":"FR sensor drain"}]},{"id":"m8_vrc_f_out","label":"VRC front OUT M8 cable plug - start of the OUT piece, output cable to IX_WS_FRONT (mates the VRC OUT panel socket)","width":390,"partId":"cp_m8_plug_6m","layoutPosition":{"x":1500,"y":0},"schematicPosition":{"x":660,"y":540},"cavities":[{"id":"c1","designation":"1","signal":"+5V (VRC supply)"},{"id":"c2","designation":"2","signal":"Gnd Out (VRC ground)"},{"id":"c3","designation":"3","signal":"FL conditioned out"},{"id":"c4","designation":"4","signal":"FR conditioned out"},{"id":"c5","designation":"5","signal":"Output cable drain"},{"id":"c6","designation":"6","signal":"spare"}]}],"terminals":[],"cables":[{"id":"cab_fl","partId":"cab_sh_2c","schematicPosition":{"x":330,"y":0},"cores":[{"id":"cab_fl_p","color":"White","source":{"id":"wss_fl","handle":"c1"},"target":{"id":"m8_vrc_f_in","handle":"c1"},"twistedWithNext":true},{"id":"cab_fl_n","color":"Green","source":{"id":"wss_fl","handle":"c2"},"target":{"id":"m8_vrc_f_in","handle":"c2"}}],"shield":{"id":"cab_fl_sh","color":"Shield","source":{"id":"m8_vrc_f_in","handle":"c3"}}},{"id":"cab_fr","partId":"cab_sh_2c","schematicPosition":{"x":330,"y":270},"cores":[{"id":"cab_fr_p","color":"White","source":{"id":"wss_fr","handle":"c1"},"target":{"id":"m8_vrc_f_in","handle":"c4"},"twistedWithNext":true},{"id":"cab_fr_n","color":"Green","source":{"id":"wss_fr","handle":"c2"},"target":{"id":"m8_vrc_f_in","handle":"c5"}}],"shield":{"id":"cab_fr_sh","color":"Shield","source":{"id":"m8_vrc_f_in","handle":"c6"}}},{"id":"cab_fout","partId":"cab_sh_4c","schematicPosition":{"x":1080,"y":480},"cores":[{"id":"cab_fout_5v","color":"Orange","source":{"id":"m8_vrc_f_out","handle":"c1"},"target":{"id":"ix_ws_front_r","handle":"c1"}},{"id":"cab_fout_gnd","color":"Black","source":{"id":"m8_vrc_f_out","handle":"c2"},"target":{"id":"ix_ws_front_r","handle":"c2"}},{"id":"cab_fout_l","color":"Blue","source":{"id":"m8_vrc_f_out","handle":"c3"},"target":{"id":"ix_ws_front_r","handle":"c3"}},{"id":"cab_fout_r","color":"Violet","source":{"id":"m8_vrc_f_out","handle":"c4"},"target":{"id":"ix_ws_front_r","handle":"c4"}}],"shield":{"id":"cab_fout_sh","color":"Shield","source":{"id":"m8_vrc_f_out","handle":"c5"},"target":{"id":"ix_ws_front_r","handle":"c5"}}}],"bundles":[{"id":"bn_m8_vrc_f_out__bp_f_fwd","sourceId":"m8_vrc_f_out","targetId":"bp_f_fwd","length":{"value":1100,"unit":"mm"}},{"id":"bn_bp_f_fwd__ix_ws_front_r","sourceId":"bp_f_fwd","targetId":"ix_ws_front_r","length":{"value":300,"unit":"mm"}},{"id":"bn_wss_fl__m8_vrc_f_in","sourceId":"wss_fl","targetId":"m8_vrc_f_in","length":{"value":1310,"unit":"mm"}},{"id":"bn_wss_fr__m8_vrc_f_in","sourceId":"wss_fr","targetId":"m8_vrc_f_in","length":{"value":970,"unit":"mm"}}],"branchPoints":[{"id":"bp_f_fwd","layoutPosition":{"x":3000,"y":90}}],"schematicNotes":[{"id":"n_scope","width":390,"schematicPosition":{"x":1920,"y":0},"text":"FRONT WHEEL SPEED - one Y harness. FL and FR ABS drops (loom C fender route, no bulkhead) run as two separate legs to the front VRC's one IN M8 plug (the IN piece ends there); the output runs through a grommet to the 6-way inline DT04-6P near the ECU (IX_WS_FRONT). The ECU side owns only the short spur and the DT06-6S mating half (ST185-A-cabin; the FR core's short screened spur to B21 runs on to ST185-B-cabin; c6 is a plugged spare)."},{"id":"n_vrc","width":390,"color":"Orange","schematicPosition":{"x":1920,"y":210},"text":"VRC NOT DRAWN. The VR conditioner, its enclosure and its panel sockets belong to the enclosure build. This harness is TWO SEPARATE PIECES with no drawn link (Daniel 2026-10-12): the IN piece - FL and FR legs into the one IN M8 plug m8_vrc_f_in (pin 1 FL VR+, 2 FL VR-, 3 FL drain, 4 FR VR+, 5 FR VR-, 6 FR drain) - and the OUT piece - OUT M8 plug m8_vrc_f_out (pin 1 +5V, 2 Gnd Out, 3 FL out, 4 FR out, 5 drain, 6 spare) -> output cable -> IX_WS_FRONT. Both plugs are the same part, a non-shielded 6-pin M8 (part TBD - OPEN-ITEMS row 74). Drains run by pin, never by connector shell."},{"id":"n_shield","width":390,"color":"Orange","schematicPosition":{"x":1920,"y":420},"text":"SHIELDS - VRC powered-device exception (docs/SHIELD-RULES.md 6.30; no connector shells, Daniel 2026-10-12). Each sensor screen floats at the sensor; its drain lands on its own IN plug pin (FL pin 3, FR pin 6). The output cable drain lands on OUT plug pin 5. Inside the box the enclosure build joins IN pins 3 / 6 to OUT pin 5 (and the case). The output screen runs on to inline pin 5 and the ECU shield ground. One screen node, grounded once, at the ECU."},{"id":"n_iso","width":390,"color":"Red","schematicPosition":{"x":1920,"y":630},"text":"TWO ISOLATION RULES. 1. The enclosure must not touch chassis - it is part of the screen, not a ground. Nylon mounting hardware. 2. The PCB must not touch the enclosure - nylon standoffs. The board grounds through the output cable only. If either is bonded, the screen picks up supply-ground noise and it will read as a flaky sensor."},{"id":"n_coat","width":390,"color":"Red","schematicPosition":{"x":1920,"y":810},"text":"MASK THE CASE RING-TERMINAL SPOT BEFORE POWDER COAT. Inside the box the drain jumper (IN pins 3 and 6 to OUT pin 5) bonds to the case there; a coated spot silently breaks the screen. No connector landing needs bare metal - the drains run by pin, not by connector shell."}],"connectorParts":[{"partNumber":"DT06-2S","manufacturer":"TE DEUTSCH","description":"CONNECTOR, PLUG, DT, 2 POS, SOCKET CONTACTS, N SEAL, GRAY","numberOfCavities":2,"gender":"Female","hasShell":false,"configurations":[{"id":"cfg","contactPartId":"ct_dt16s_ni","cavityPlugPartId":"pl_sz16","lockPartId":"lp_w2s"}],"url":"https://www.te.com/usa-en/product-DT06-2S.html","image":{"path":"97d068b9-43c9-4b19-b8c0-ccc45b65fb7b/1790014830313.png","source":"cloud"},"pinout":{"id":"te-deutsch-dt-2","name":"DT 2-way","pins":[{"x":2.73,"y":0,"size":4.2},{"x":-2.73,"y":0,"size":4.2}],"outline":{"type":"rect","width":15.1,"height":11.7,"cornerRadius":2.5},"features":[{"y":-5.85,"layer":"behind","shape":{"type":"rect","width":8.5,"height":3}}],"mirrored":true},"designationStrategy":{"type":"sequential"},"id":"cp_dt2s_ni"},{"id":"cp_dt04_6p","partNumber":"DT04-6P","manufacturer":"TE DEUTSCH","description":"CONNECTOR, RECEPTACLE, DT, 6 POS, PIN CONTACTS, N SEAL, GRAY","numberOfCavities":6,"gender":"Male","hasShell":false,"configurations":[{"id":"cfg","contactPartId":"ct_dt16p","cavityPlugPartId":"pl_sz16","lockPartId":"lp_w6p"}],"url":"https://www.te.com/usa-en/product-DT04-6P.html"},{"id":"cp_m8_plug_6m","partNumber":"TBD (M8 6-pos male cable plug, unshielded, field-attachable, 20 AWG)","manufacturer":"TBD","description":"CONNECTOR, CIRCULAR, M8, CABLE PLUG, MALE, 6 POS, UNSHIELDED, FIELD ATTACHABLE","numberOfCavities":6,"gender":"Male","hasShell":false,"configurations":[{"id":"cfg","contactPartId":"ct_m8_tbd"}]}],"contactParts":[{"partNumber":"0462-201-16141","manufacturer":"TE DEUTSCH","type":"Crimp","gender":"Socket","minGauge":{"value":20,"unit":"AWG"},"maxGauge":{"value":16,"unit":"AWG"},"contactColor":"Silver","description":"CONTACT, SOCKET, SOLID, SIZE 16, NICKEL, 16-20 AWG, 13 A","id":"ct_dt16s_ni"},{"id":"ct_dt16p","partNumber":"0460-202-1631","manufacturer":"TE DEUTSCH","description":"CONTACT, PIN, SOLID, SIZE 16, GOLD, 16-20 AWG, 13 A","type":"Crimp","gender":"Pin","minGauge":{"value":20,"unit":"AWG"},"maxGauge":{"value":16,"unit":"AWG"},"contactColor":"Gold"},{"id":"ct_m8_tbd","partNumber":"TBD (integral to the M8 6-pos plug)","manufacturer":"TBD","type":"Crimp","gender":"Pin","description":"CONTACT, PIN, M8, INTEGRAL"}],"cableParts":[{"id":"cab_sh_2c","partNumber":"GENERIC SHLD CABLE 2C TP 20AWG","manufacturer":"generic","description":"CABLE, SHIELDED, 2 CONDUCTOR TWISTED PAIR, 20 AWG, FOIL + TINNED COPPER BRAID, JACKETED","cores":[{"id":"k1","color":"White","twistedWithNext":true,"gauge":{"value":20,"unit":"AWG"}},{"id":"k2","color":"Green","gauge":{"value":20,"unit":"AWG"}}],"shielded":true},{"id":"cab_sh_4c","partNumber":"GENERIC SHLD CABLE 4C 20AWG","manufacturer":"generic","description":"CABLE, SHIELDED, 4 CONDUCTOR, 20 AWG, FOIL + TINNED COPPER BRAID, JACKETED","cores":[{"id":"k1","color":"Orange","gauge":{"value":20,"unit":"AWG"}},{"id":"k2","color":"Black","gauge":{"value":20,"unit":"AWG"}},{"id":"k3","color":"Blue","gauge":{"value":20,"unit":"AWG"}},{"id":"k4","color":"Violet","gauge":{"value":20,"unit":"AWG"}}],"shielded":true}],"lockParts":[{"partNumber":"W2S","manufacturer":"TE DEUTSCH","description":"WEDGELOCK, DT, 2-WAY PLUG","id":"lp_w2s"},{"id":"lp_w6p","partNumber":"W6P","manufacturer":"TE DEUTSCH","description":"WEDGELOCK, DT, 6-WAY RECEPTACLE"}],"cavityPlugParts":[{"partNumber":"114017","manufacturer":"TE DEUTSCH","description":"PLUG, SEALING, CAVITY, SIZE 16, WHITE","id":"pl_sz16"}]}